{"slug":"artist-series","title":"Penumbra Artist Series","nav":"Penumbra Artist Series","desc":"","img":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/fbf65dcb-83f7-434d-a817-6d838f572474/20250212_B_SCHUTMAAT-42-2.jpg","updated":1773616617994,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p>The Penumbra Artist Series brings to life the work of featured photographers and other notable guest artists and scholars, offering a unique opportunity to engage with them in an intimate setting as they discuss their work and process.</p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":8,"blocks":[{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>SPRING  2026 </strong></p>"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/fbf65dcb-83f7-434d-a817-6d838f572474/20250212_B_SCHUTMAAT-42-2.jpg","alt":"Image: Bryan Schutmaat. February 12, 2025.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image: Bryan Schutmaat. February 12, 2025.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":7728,"h":5152,"href":"/artist-series-spring-2026","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>2025</strong></p>"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/06221aab-bbcf-4dc7-a84c-7930a0c04d83/Victoria_Sambunaris_Lecture_2025.jpg","alt":"Image: Victoria Sambunaris. April 2, 2025.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image: Victoria Sambunaris. April 2, 2025.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":2500,"h":1550,"href":"/artist-series-spring-2025","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]}]}]},{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>PREVIOUS LECTURES </strong>(2015-2024)</p>"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/d9c4bb04-be0c-4a6e-aa19-cbe54c88b9c9/Screenshot+2025-05-20+at+8.56.23+AM.png","alt":"Image: Naeem Mohaiemen, April 2, 2024.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image: Naeem Mohaiemen, April 2, 2024.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":1682,"h":1116,"href":"/lectures","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>All lectures are <strong>In-Person </strong>only, and are free to attend.  We ask that you kindly RSVP. </p><p>Any changes to the program will be announced online. All lectures and other events are held at Penumbra Foundation at 7pm. <br/><br/>36 E. 30th St. New York, NY, 10016 (between Madison Ave. &amp; Park Ave. South<br/>(917) 288-0343 | info@penumbrafoundation.org | penumbrafoundation.org</p>"}]}